<title>SRI LANKA: Hatton National's 1996 net falls 6.0 pct.</title>
<headline>Hatton National's 1996 net falls 6.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Audited results of Hatton National Bank Ltd for the year ending 31 December, 1996.</p>
<p>(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>			    1996		    1995</p>
<p>     Income	   4,796.28   vs	 3,567.07</p>
<p>     Net profit	 452.82   vs	   483.24</p>
<p>     Tax		  120.00   vs	    80.30</p>
<p>NOTE - The blue chip Hatton National Bank is one of four commercial banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
